During SdRP's Congress on 13 May, Kwaśniewski secured his party's endorsement for president with 296 out of 300 votes. Some delegates believed [[Józef Oleksy]] should become the candidate instead.<ref name=Dudek/><ref name=Woliński>{{cite book |last=Woliński |first=Przemysław |title=Transformacja Sojuszu Lewicy Demokratycznej – od koalicji wyborczej do partii politycznej |url=https://repozytorium.ukw.edu.pl/handle/item/4121}}</ref> A poll conducted in December 1994 suggested 71% of potential SLD voters supported Kwaśniewski as the party's candidate, 7% supported [[Włodzimierz Cimoszewicz]] and 16% supported Oleksy.<ref name=CBOS1>{{cite web |url=https://www.cbos.pl/SPISKOM.POL/1994/K_197_94.PDF |title=WYBORY PREZYDENCKIE - PREFERENCJE W GRUDNIU '94}}</ref>

===Nonpartisan Bloc for Support of Reforms===
Lech Wałęsa was endorsed by the Bloc.<ref name=Dudek/> A sizable part of anti-Wałęsa, reformist activists in the Bloc, like [[Andrzej Olechowski]] or [[Zbigniew Religa]] split off before the election, the latter forming the {{ill|Partia Republikanie|pl|Republicans Party}}, which supported {{ill|Marek Markiewicz|pl}} after Religa dissented with his party's intention to run himself as its candidate. Markiewicz dropped out and endorsed Wałęsa before the first round of the election.<ref name=Dudek/><ref name=PiK>{{cite book |last=Paszkiewicz |first=Krystyna |date=2004 |title=Partie i koalicje polityczne III Rzeczypospolitej |location=Wrocław |publisher=Wydawnictwo Uniwersytetu Wrocławskiego |isbn=83-229-2493-3}}</ref> Besides his own party, Wałęsa received the endorsement of other parties: a section of the ZChN endorsed him on 18 September, later joined by the rest of the party (though it didn't revoke its endorsement of their original candidate, [[Hanna Gronkiewicz-Waltz]]) on 29 October.<ref name=bd>{{cite web |last=Dziemidok |first=Bożena |date=1997 |title=Prawica w wyborach prezydenckich '95. Proces wyłaniania kandydatów |language=pl |trans-title=The Right in the 1995 Presidential Election. The Process of Nominating Candidates |url=https://bazhum.muzhp.pl/media/texts/annales-universitatis-mariae-curie-skodowska-sectio-k-politologia/1997-tom-4/annales_universitatis_mariae_curie_sklodowska_sectio_k_politologia-r1997-t4-s121-138.pdf |access-date=2025-04-21}}</ref>

